---
// Fig. for "Extension Fields & Towers": addition is part-by-part, and
// multiplication is ordinary algebra plus one replacement rule, u² = 2 —
// worked through (3 + 5u) + (4 + 9u) and (3 + u)(2 + 5u) mod 13.
---
<svg viewBox="0 0 760 500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;">
  <text x="380" y="26" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e9eef5" font-size="16" font-weight="800" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">add and multiply</text>

  <rect x="40" y="46" width="680" height="42" rx="10" fill="#111c2e" stroke="#3ab7ff" stroke-width="1.5" />
  <text x="380" y="72" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fdcff" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">How do the new numbers add and multiply?</text>

  <text x="380" y="108" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b96a8" font-size="12" font-weight="700" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">STEP 1 &#8212; add part by part</text>
  <text x="380" y="132" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e9eef5" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">(3 + 5u) + (4 + 9u) = 7 + 14u = 7 + 1u</text>
  <text x="380" y="152" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b96a8" font-size="11.5" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">14 &#8722; 13 = 1</text>

  <text x="380" y="186" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b96a8" font-size="12" font-weight="700" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">STEP 2 &#8212; multiply, then replace u<tspan dy="-5" font-size="70%">2</tspan></text>
  <text x="380" y="210" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e9eef5" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">(3 + u)(2 + 5u) = 6 + 15u + 2u + 5u<tspan dy="-6" font-size="65%">2</tspan></text>
  <text x="380" y="232" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e9eef5" font-size="13" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">replace u<tspan dy="-6" font-size="65%">2</tspan><tspan dy="6"> with 2: 6 + 17u + 10 = 16 + 17u</tspan></text>

  <text x="380" y="266" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b96a8" font-size="12" font-weight="700" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">STEP 3 &#8212; reduce mod 13</text>
  <text x="380" y="290" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e9eef5" font-size="13.5" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">16 = 3 and 17 = 4, so the answer is 3 + 4u</text>

  <rect x="220" y="310" width="320" height="48" rx="10" fill="#0e1f16" stroke="#5ddc8a" stroke-width="1.8" />
  <text x="380" y="340" text-anchor="middle" fill="#5ddc8a" font-size="15" font-weight="800" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">(3 + u)(2 + 5u) = 3 + 4u</text>

  <text x="380" y="382" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b96a8" font-size="12.5" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">constants: 6 + 10 = 16, and 16 &#8722; 13 = 3 &#10003;</text>

  <line x1="40" y1="400" x2="720" y2="400" stroke="#223049" stroke-width="1" />
  <text x="380" y="424" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fdcff" font-size="15.5" font-weight="800" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">ORDINARY ALGEBRA, PLUS u<tspan dy="-6" font-size="65%">2</tspan><tspan dy="6"> = 2</tspan></text>
  <text x="380" y="446" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b96a8" font-size="12.5" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">The answer always has just two parts: a + b&#183;u.</text>
</svg>
